NODE id=matrix/cody/internal/worker.Worker.toolExec kind=method
  digest=b3:f527489712c405217239ddb34fc27b33064af805202a0ca4506ed5e035d08cfd file=cody/internal/worker/worker.go range=604:652 lang=go exported=false byte_range=18653:20114
  sig=func (w *Worker) toolExec(ctx context.Context, args map[string]interface{}) string
  doc=toolExec runs a shell command. A command that finishes within\nautoBackgroundAfter returns inline (overflow-spilled when oversized); a\nlonger one is auto-promoted to a background job so the step returns\nimmediately and the worker keeps moving (poll with job_output, stop with\njob_kill). An explicit timeout_secs at or under the promotion threshold is\nhonored as a hard kill (the legacy bounded-exec contract).
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/cody/internal/worker.Worker
  ^defines=matrix/cody/internal/worker/worker.go

